      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "7. relation 关系字段（RelationResolver）\n标签：`relation:子表sheet,父结构references字段,子结构foreign字段`\n非列绑定：走 onRelation → ResolveRelation\ngetChildData：对子表 newScanner.scan，同一 sheet 结果缓存\nmatchAndSet：父行 references（string）== 子项 foreign（string）\n字段为 slice → 收集所有匹配子行；单对象 → 首条匹配或指针",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": "ifr5c",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 771054,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "seed": 77024,
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1776073100000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "originalText": "7. relation 关系字段（RelationResolver）\n标签：`relation:子表sheet,父结构references字段,子结构foreign字段`\n非列绑定：走 onRelation → ResolveRelation\ngetChildData：对子表 newScanner.scan，同一 sheet 结果缓存\nmatchAndSet：父行 references（string）== 子项 foreign（string）\n字段为 slice → 收集所有匹配子行；单对象 → 首条匹配或指针",
      "autoResize": true
    },
